{"4713940": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Monster Fantasy", "steam_appid": 4713940, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713940/extras/7a25b31705a73109906a9e31ec03b7f4.poster.avif?t=1786693267\" width=598 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713940/extras/7a25b31705a73109906a9e31ec03b7f4.webm?t=1786693267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713940/extras/7a25b31705a73109906a9e31ec03b7f4.mp4?t=1786693267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713940/extras/03092c2003de9b51a3887186264e1b98.avif?t=1786693267\" width=646 height=65 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an amnesiac hero in the Kingdom of Eldoras, you can follow the classic path of an adventurer—hunting monsters to earn materials and rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713940/extras/992ca6950095208f5a2bb96fa9dd0bcf.poster.avif?t=1786693267\" width=598 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713940/extras/992ca6950095208f5a2bb96fa9dd0bcf.webm?t=1786693267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713940/extras/992ca6950095208f5a2bb96fa9dd0bcf.mp4?t=1786693267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >or spend your days fishing, chopping wood, mining, cooking, crafting your own equipment, and enjoying a variety of life-sim activities. Play freely, your way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713940/extras/2a70e238f107e6dd72659fcbb35c2fc6.poster.avif?t=1786693267\" width=598 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713940/extras/2a70e238f107e6dd72659fcbb35c2fc6.webm?t=1786693267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713940/extras/2a70e238f107e6dd72659fcbb35c2fc6.mp4?t=1786693267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin a life of your own in a world where legends meet everyday life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713940/extras/84007197c009e8303956166ea9d71c63.poster.avif?t=1786693267\" width=598 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713940/extras/84007197c009e8303956166ea9d71c63.webm?t=1786693267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713940/extras/84007197c009e8303956166ea9d71c63.mp4?t=1786693267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713940/extras/f789278a878c066cad1e647745789ebe.avif?t=1786693267\" width=772 height=65 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Around 50 giant monsters await your challenge. Each monster has its own unique behavior, and learning their traits will help you claim victory more easily.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713940/extras/c7014b3e50d6275f2969d5c521b4c738.poster.avif?t=1786693267\" width=598 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713940/extras/c7014b3e50d6275f2969d5c521b4c738.webm?t=1786693267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713940/extras/c7014b3e50d6275f2969d5c521b4c738.mp4?t=1786693267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from 4 different classes: Warrior, Mage, Archer, and Martial Artist. Each class features its own unique combat mechanics. Will you develop them all, or specialize in your favorite? The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713940/extras/df23e18e19ba2f78501915d07bb9fe6b.poster.avif?t=1786693267\" width=598 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713940/extras/df23e18e19ba2f78501915d07bb9fe6b.webm?t=1786693267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713940/extras/df23e18e19ba2f78501915d07bb9fe6b.mp4?t=1786693267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713940/extras/0c21f6f5816d1db8cc68d3ad9bc19908.avif?t=1786693267\" width=772 height=65 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start a new life in a beautiful village! Around 100 villagers are waiting to meet you, each with their own personality, strengths, and interests. Build friendships with them and work together to create a wonderful home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713940/extras/cd89a0132b26a7123fd591256207fafd.avif?t=1786693267\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713940/extras_big/cd89a0132b26a7123fd591256207fafd.webp?t=1786693267 width=1560 height=804 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713940/extras/6fc1add94d472ebdfc7785af534f6e82.avif?t=1786693267\" width=646 height=65 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can tame defeated monsters as pets and help them grow and evolve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713940/extras/418590e9b6af6051bfc950c0aafef733.poster.avif?t=1786693267\" width=598 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713940/extras/418590e9b6af6051bfc950c0aafef733.webm?t=1786693267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713940/extras/418590e9b6af6051bfc950c0aafef733.mp4?t=1786693267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ride your monsters across valleys, rainforests, icy plains, volcanoes, and more as you explore every corner of the vast kingdom—and fight alongside them in battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713940/extras/65ac65cf73e38613bf20bd6bf2e0e05a.poster.avif?t=1786693267\" width=598 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713940/extras/65ac65cf73e38613bf20bd6bf2e0e05a.webm?t=1786693267\" ty